# Text with variables filled in (parse_string: "$NUM0" and the like, the grammar choices "$<#0:...>"): the tutorial's
# note, then the colony pod founds the first base (key B), whose screen has labels made from the base's
# numbers ("Growth: 22 turns", "TURNS: 7", the energy and eco-damage lines), then the same screen a few
# seconds on and after F2. Loaded from the game's autosave. Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
